1218710141","SecondaryAttribute":"Do you have a US mobile phone number that can receive text messages (SMS)?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Do you have a US mobile phone number that can receive text messages (SMS)?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Do you have a US mobile phone number that can receive text messages (SMS)?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Do you have a US mobile phone number that can receive text messages (SMS)?","DataExportTag":"Q4","QuestionID":"QID1218710141"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710142","SecondaryAttribute":"Based on your answers, you are not eligible to participate in this study. Thank you for your inte...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Based on your answers, you are not eligible to participate in this study. Thank you for your interest and time.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Based on your answers, you are not eligible to participate in this study. Thank you for your inte...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Based on your answers, you are not eligible to participate in this study. Thank you for your interest and time.","DataExportTag":"Instr","QuestionID":"QID1218710142"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710152","SecondaryAttribute":"We care about the quality of our survey data. For us to get the most accurate measures of your op...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We care about the quality of our survey data. For us to get the most accurate measures of your opinions, it is important that you provide thoughtful answers to each question in this survey.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We care about the quality of our survey data. For us to get the most accurate measures of your op...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We care about the quality of our survey data. For us to get the most accurate measures of your opinions, it is important that you provide thoughtful answers to each question in this survey.","DataExportTag":"Commit_Instr","QuestionID":"QID1218710152"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710153","SecondaryAttribute":"Do you commit to providing thoughtful answers to the questions in this survey?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Do you commit to providing thoughtful answers to the questions in this survey?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Do you commit to providing thoughtful answers to the questions in this survey?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes, I will."},"2":{"Display":"I can't promise either way."},"3":{"Display":"No, I will not."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Do you commit to providing thoughtful answers to the questions in this survey?","DataExportTag":"Commit","QuestionID":"QID1218710153"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710154","SecondaryAttribute":"Permission to Take Part in a Human Research Study Georgetown University Title: Personality Change...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Permission to Take Part in a Human Research Study<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Georgetown University<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"tab-stops:144.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Titl<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">e: Personality Change Motivation Study<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Key Information<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">:<i> <\/i><\/span><\/span><\/b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The following is a short summary of this study to help you decide whether or not to be a part of this study. More detailed information is listed later on in this form.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Why am I being invited to take part in a research study?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">We invite you to take part in a research study <\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">because you have completed the pre-screening questionnaire and are eligible to participate in this study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What should I know about a research study?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span>\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Whether or not you take part is up to you.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You can choose not to take part.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You can agree to take part and later change your mind.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Your decision will not be held against you.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You can ask all the questions you want before you decide.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Why is this research being done?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The purpose of this study is to investigate people\u2019s motivation to change their personality and become more prosocial.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">How long will the research last and what will I need to do?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">We expect that you will be in this research study for 30 minutes to complete an online survey. <\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">More detailed information about the study procedures can be found under <i>\u201c<\/i><b>What happens if I say yes, I want to be in this research?\u201d<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Is there any way being in this study could be bad for me?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><b>Email Communication. <\/b>This study involves email communication. The security flaws related to this service could expose your identity and involvement in the research to people not associated with the study. While we will work to keep email communications as private as possible, it is not a completely secure form of communication.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There are no significant risks associated with the surveys or behavioral tasks in this study. However, some of the questionnaires contain questions about sensitive topics. You do not have to answer any questions you do not want to answer.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Will being in this study help me in any way?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There are no benefits to you from your taking part in this research. We cannot promise any benefits to others from your taking part in this research. However, possible benefits to others include<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> gaining knowledge about prosociality change motivations.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What happens if I do not want to be in this research?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Participation in research is completely voluntary. You can decide to participate or not to participate.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Your alternative to participating in this research study is to not participate.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Detailed Information:<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><b><i> <\/i><\/b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The following is more detailed information about this study in addition to the information listed above.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Who can I talk to?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">If you have questions, concerns, or complaints, or think the research has hurt you, talk to the research team at <\/span><a href=\"mailto:personalityplus@georgetown.edu\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">personalityplus@georgetown.edu<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The helpline for the Substance Abuse and Mental Health Services Administration is available anytime at 1-800-662-HELP (4357) (for more information, visit https:\/\/www.samhsa.gov\/find-help\/national-helpline). Crisis hotlines and resources (including long-term help) are also available on the American Psychological Association website at https:\/\/www.apa.org\/topics\/crisis-hotlines.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">This research has been reviewed and approved by an Institutional Review Board (\u201cIRB\u201d). You may talk to them at (202) 687-1506 or <\/span><a href=\"mailto:irboard@georgetown.edu\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">irboard@georgetown.edu<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> if:<\/span><\/span><\/span>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Your questions, concerns, or complaints are not being answered by the research team.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You cannot reach the research team.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You want to talk to someone besides the research team.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You have questions about your rights as a research subject.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You want to get information or provide input about this research.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">How many people will be studied?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">We expect about 500 people will be in this research study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What happens if I say yes, I want to be in this research?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You will be asked to complete a survey that is expected to take 30 minutes.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What happens if I say yes, but I change my mind later?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You can leave the research at any time. It will not be held against you.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">If you decide to leave the research, you will not receive the full compensation for participation. <\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What happens to the information collected for the research?<\/span><\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Every effort will be made to protect your personal information to the extent allowed by law. Your answers to the questions in this study will not be directly linked to your identity. Records of research study participants are stored and kept indefinitely on a secure cloud storage platform. However, we cannot guarantee absolute confidentiality.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You will not be identified in any reports or publications resulting from this study. In addition to the researchers and research institution(s) conducting this study, organizations that may request to inspect and\/or copy your research records for quality assurance data analysis and other research related and operational or administrative purposes, include groups such as: Georgetown University, Georgetown University Institutional Review Board (IRB), federal research oversight agencies.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Researchers are mandated reporters by law. This means that researchers are required by law to report any information about child abuse, elder abuse, and threats to harm yourself or others to the authorities. Everything else you tell us, including any information about past behaviors or substance use, will be protected by the confidentiality protections described above (although not by an NIH Certificate of Confidentiality, which is sometimes applied to studies investigating highly sensitive topics).<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Can I be removed from the research without my OK?<\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The researchers may stop the study or take you out of the study at any time without your approval.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">How will I be paid?<\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">We will compensate you with up to $8 through the online survey platform or Amazon eGift cards. If you enroll in this study through the SONA study pool, you will be compensated with 1 SONA credit for completing the survey and will not be compensated monetarily. <\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Administrative personnel outside of the research team who are involved in processing your compensation may be aware of your identity (name\/email address associated with your Amazon account). They will not have access to your data from the study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other\"><span style=\"font-family:Times,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">By clicking \u201cI consent to participate in this study,\u201d I acknowledge that I have read and understand the information and am choosing to participate.<\/span><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Permission to Take Part in a Human Research Study Georgetown University Title: Personality Change...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes, I consent to participate in this study."},"3":{"Display":"No, I do not consent to participate in this study."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,"3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Add consent form here (Waiting for IRB approval)","DataExportTag":"Consent","QuestionID":"QID1218710154"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710219","SecondaryAttribute":"In the following section you will find a series of statements about you.\u00a0Please read each stateme..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In the following section you will find a series of statements about you.&nbsp;<b>Please read each statement and decide how much you agree or disagree with that statement.<\/b>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the following section you will find a series of statements about you.\u00a0Please read each stateme...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In the following section you will find a series of statements about you.&nbsp;<b>Please read each statement and decide how much you agree or disagree with that statement.<\/b>","DataExportTag":"Instr","QuestionID":"QID1218710219"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710220","SecondaryAttribute":"I would be quite bored by a visit to an art gallery.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"I would be quite bored by a visit to an art gallery.","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"Ques