">I\u2019d be tempted to use counterfeit money, if I were sure I could get away with it.<\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"HEX_60r","QuestionID":"QID1218710279"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710280","SecondaryAttribute":"I am careful in reading these questions, which is why I will now indicate that I strongly disagree.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"I am careful in reading these questions, which is why I will now indicate that I strongly disagree.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"I am careful in reading these questions, which is why I will now indicate that I strongly disagree.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1 = strongly disagree"},"2":{"Display":"2 = disagree"},"3":{"Display":"3 = neutral"},"4":{"Display":"4 = agree"},"5":{"Display":"5 = strongly agree"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"I am careful in reading these questions, which is why I will now indicate that I strongly disagree.","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"attention","QuestionID":"QID1218710280"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710333","SecondaryAttribute":"Now, we are going to tell you how prosocial you actually are based on the personality assessment...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Now, we are going to tell you how prosocial you actually are based on the personality assessment you completed at the beginning of this survey.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<u>Your score is <b>${gr:\/\/SC_3KUcPkPWLa71NEG\/WeightedMean}<\/b>. Comparing your score to a group of over 300,000 people who have completed this assessment, you are <b>${e:\/\/Field\/percentile}<\/b>.<\/u><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#bdc3c7;\"><b>Prosociality: <\/b>Persons who are high in prosociality (a trait researchers sometimes call Honesty-Humility) avoid manipulating others for personal gain, feel little temptation to break rules, are uninterested in lavish wealth and luxuries, feel no special entitlement to elevated social status, and engage in behaviors that benefit other people. Conversely, persons with very low scores on this scale will flatter others to get what they want, are inclined to break rules for personal profit, are motivated by material gain, and feel a strong sense of self-importance.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now, we are going to tell you how prosocial you actually are based on the personality assessment...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Your Prosociality (Honesty-Humility) score is:&nbsp;${gr:\/\/SC_bkiUl32r2z2W06i\/WeightedMean}<\/b><br><br><b>Description: <\/b>Individuals  who  score  <u>high<\/u>  on Prosociality (Honesty-Humility) tend  not  to  manipulate others  for  personal  gain  and  violate  rules,  and  are  relatively  uninterested  in  wealth,  luxury, social status, and privileges. Individuals who score <u>low<\/u> on this scale put themselves first, are \nattached to material things, are more likely to resist the temptation to break rules if they benefit from it, and are more likely to flatter if this helps achieve personal goals.<br><br><b>Percentiles: <\/b>To help you understand your score, we provide the percentiles of the scores of over 370,000 global participants recruited from an online survey site. If, for example, your score is above the 70th percentile but below the 80th percentile, you scored higher than 70% of the sample but are not in the top 20%. The 50th percentile represents the typical or average respondent.<br><br><u>The percentiles are listed below:<\/u><br>10th percentile: 2.3<br>20th percentile: 2.7<br>30th percentile: 3.0<br>40th percentile: 3.2<br>50th percentile: 3.4<br>60th percentile: 3.6<br>70th percentile: 3.8<br>80th percentile: 4.0<br>90th percentile: 4.3<br>","DataExportTag":"Instr","QuestionID":"QID1218710333"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218710334","SecondaryAttribute":"If I could change myself, I would like to be lower\/higher on Prosociality.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If I could change myself, I would like to be lower\/higher on Prosociality.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If I could change myself, I would like to be lower\/higher on Prosociality.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Much lower"},"2":{"Display":"Lower"},"3":{"Display":"Slightly lower"},"4":{"Display":"Neither lower nor higher"},"5":{"Display":"Slightly higher"},"6":{"Display":"Higher"},"7":{"Display":"Much higher"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"If I could change myself, I would like to be lower\/higher on Prosociality.","DataExportTag":"Pro_change_feedback","QuestionID":"QID1218710334"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1218715291","SecondaryAttribute":"Below are nine life domains. Please use the scale below to indicate your satisfaction with each d...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Below are nine life domains. Please use the scale below to indicate your satisfaction with each domain.","DefaultChoices":f