ings to help others is at the core of what it means to be \na good person or a moral person.<\/b><br><br>How much does this information make you want to become more prosocial?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Mot_moral","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In most cultures, doing things to help others is at the core of what it means to be a good person...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Not at all"},"2":{"Display":"Slightly"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately"},"4":{"Display":"Very"},"5":{"Display":"Extremely"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID149"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8pFXWyvs2Y7YcMC","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID150","SecondaryAttribute":"Helping others is associated with feeling more positive emotions, having better self-esteem, and...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Helping others is associated with feeling more positive emotions, having better self-esteem, and experiencing fewer symptoms of depression. \n <\/b><br><br>\nHow much does this information make you want to become more prosocial? <br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Mot_emotion","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Helping others is associated with feeling more positive emotions, having better self-esteem, and...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Not at all"},"2":{"Display":"Slightly"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately"},"4":{"Display":"Very"},"5":{"Display":"Extremely"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type"